{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13404","headline":"初去郡斋书怀 · 薛据","name":"初去郡斋书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃徒辞汝頴，怀古独凄然。\n尚想文王化，犹思巢父贤。\n时移多谗巧，大道竟谁传。\n况是疾风起，悠悠旌斾悬。\n征鸟无返翼，归流不停川。\n已经霜雪下，乃验松柏坚。\n回首望城邑，迢迢间云烟。\n志士不伤物，小人皆自妍。\n感时惟责己，在道非怨天。\n从此适乐土，东归知几年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}